{"id":"transcriber-kxj","title":"v0.2.x — Install optimization (minimal default, auto-clean, on-demand install, reinstall verb)","description":"Flip transcribe setup from opt-out to opt-in. Default shrinks to mlx + antony66 only (~6 GB, ~8 min vs current 20 GB / 30 min). Auto-clean -hf source dirs after a strict sanity check (+ cpp build intermediates). New engine.checkReady() primitive enables in-place TTY-gated install prompts when the user runs a command whose engine isn't installed (CI-safe: non-TTY = fail-fast). First-class `transcribe reinstall [name|--all]` verb. The checkReady() primitive is reused by the MCP plugin spec's transcribe_setup_status tool. See specs/install-optimization/spec.md for the full design + §8.5 task graph. Est. ~9 h.","status":"open","priority":1,"issue_type":"epic","created_at":"2026-05-18T02:24:13.237002Z","created_by":"ivorobiev","updated_at":"2026-05-18T02:24:13.237002Z","source_repo":".","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0}
