{"id":"transcriber-kxj.9","title":"T9: scripts/setup-all.sh — rewire to default 'mlx,antony66'; implement --with, --full, --clean, --force, --wipe; deprecation notice for --no-*","description":"INSTALL_SET starts at {mlx, antony66}. --with <name> adds. --full sets to everything. --clean runs only the cleanup pass. --force re-downloads even if present. --wipe rm -rf's the named items before install. --no-* still parses, prints stderr deprecation, implies --full minus that name.","status":"open","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","estimated_minutes":90,"created_at":"2026-05-18T02:26:49.114897Z","created_by":"ivorobiev","updated_at":"2026-05-18T02:26:50.996692Z","source_repo":".","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"transcriber-kxj.9","depends_on_id":"transcriber-kxj","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-05-18T02:26:49.114897Z","created_by":"ivorobiev","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""},{"issue_id":"transcriber-kxj.9","depends_on_id":"transcriber-kxj.6","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-05-18T02:26:50.996392Z","created_by":"ivorobiev","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
